{
    "title": "Mini Heroes: Magic Throne",
    "description": "Join Mars on his epic adventure to reclaim the throne!\r\nIn Valoria, where magic and nature once thrived, darkness falls as a powerful sorcerer seizes the throne.\r\nPrince Mars, armed with his father\u2019s final gift\u2014a magical helmet\u2014retreats to the forest. \r\nAs shadows grow, can Mars save his people and reclaim his homeland? \r\nThe fate of Valoria rests in your hands.\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 BOUNTY NEW PLAYER GIFTS</b>\r\nCome and claim your rewards, no strings attached!\r\nEnjoy 30 guaranteed summons daily, with a total of 7,777 summons!\r\nAlso receive a SSR hero, 777 diamonds, and other rare props!\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 NO MORE GRINDING</b>\r\nUpgrade your favorite Mini Heroes with AFK rewards.\r\nSimply idle and relax with auto-loot. Leveling up heroes has never been easier!\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 ULTIMATE HERO STRATEGY</b>\r\nNo more fodder heroes, advance your heroes' quality from bottom to the top!\r\nIf you fancy new heroes, swap them with no extra cost! \r\nExplore deeper hero strategies with Glyph, Artifact, and more features!\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 CHILLING AND FISHING</b>\r\nTake a moment to chill out and fish in the kingdom of Valoria.\r\nComplete the fish collection and boost your overall power!\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 RICH GAMEPLAY AWAITS</b>\r\nDive into endless adventures and face thrilling challenges!\r\nShow your courage and power in the Tower of the Throne, Land of Trials, and more!\r\n\r\n<b>\u00b7 DOMINATE THE GLOBAL ARENA</b>\r\nShowcase your skills and strategy in thrilling 1v1 combat!\r\nLead your tribe to victory and conquer in epic GvG battles against players worldwide!\r\n\r\n=====<b> Contact us </b>=====\r\nOfficial Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/MiniHeroesMagicThrone\r\nOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/qWsxMfbsvC",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join Mars on his epic adventure to reclaim the throne!<br>In Valoria, where magic and nature once thrived, darkness falls as a powerful sorcerer seizes the throne.<br>Prince Mars, armed with his father\u2019s final gift\u2014a magical helmet\u2014retreats to the forest. <br>As shadows grow, can Mars save his people and reclaim his homeland? <br>The fate of Valoria rests in your hands.<br><br><b>\u00b7 BOUNTY NEW PLAYER GIFTS</b><br>Come and claim your rewards, no strings attached!<br>Enjoy 30 guaranteed summons daily, with a total of 7,777 summons!<br>Also receive a SSR hero, 777 diamonds, and other rare props!<br><br><b>\u00b7 NO MORE GRINDING</b><br>Upgrade your favorite Mini Heroes with AFK rewards.<br>Simply idle and relax with auto-loot. Leveling up heroes has never been easier!<br><br><b>\u00b7 ULTIMATE HERO STRATEGY</b><br>No more fodder heroes, advance your heroes&#39; quality from bottom to the top!<br>If you fancy new heroes, swap them with no extra cost! <br>Explore deeper hero strategies with Glyph, Artifact, and more features!<br><br><b>\u00b7 CHILLING AND FISHING</b><br>Take a moment to chill out and fish in the kingdom of Valoria.<br>Complete the fish collection and boost your overall power!<br><br><b>\u00b7 RICH GAMEPLAY AWAITS</b><br>Dive into endless adventures and face thrilling challenges!<br>Show your courage and power in the Tower of the Throne, Land of Trials, and more!<br><br><b>\u00b7 DOMINATE THE GLOBAL ARENA</b><br>Showcase your skills and strategy in thrilling 1v1 combat!<br>Lead your tribe to victory and conquer in epic GvG battles against players worldwide!<br><br>=====<b> Contact us </b>=====<br>Official Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/MiniHeroesMagicThrone<br>Official Discord: https://discord.gg/qWsxMfbsvC",
